Package: ApproxOp
Type: Package
Title: A Unified Framework for Positive Linear Approximation Operators
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Edmond",
        family = "Aliaga",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "edmond.aliaga@uni-pr.edu"
    )
Description: Provides a unified computational framework for defining,
    evaluating, analyzing, comparing, and visualizing positive linear
    approximation operators. The package supports classical and generalized
    discrete operators, ordinary and central moments, convergence analysis,
    numerical diagnostics, parameter studies, and user-defined operators.
